# Generated by `tree-sitter generate` from grammar.js. `check.sh` regenerates
# before it parses anything, so the checked-in tree stays close to the two files
# a person actually edits: grammar.js and src/scanner.c.
#
# `src/parser.c` and `src/tree_sitter/` are the exception, and they are checked
# in: `../zed/extension.toml` points Zed at this directory inside this
# repository, and Zed compiles those two with clang rather than running the
# tree-sitter CLI. A file it cannot generate is a file the repository must hold.
src/grammar.json
src/node-types.json
grammar.json
node-types.json
